<h1>Data and documents conformance</h1>
<p class="lede">How much of each W3C and related test suite the built-in engine passes for the data and document formats beyond the browser platform: RDF, SPARQL, OWL 2, SHACL, ShEx, JSON-LD, CSV on the Web, RML, RIF, Verifiable Credentials and DIDs, XML, XSLT, Schematron, JSON Schema and MathML. One row per technology family; open a family for its specifications, versions and test populations, and a suite for its sub-manifests and history.</p>
<main id="app"><p class="muted">Loading the recorded runs…</p></main>
<footer>The numbers come from the suite runs recorded on the wpt-scores branch of danbri/factoidal-builds. The data files of this page and their history are on its hub-data branch.</footer>
